  "body": "Deadline sale: closes 4:00 pm Friday 27 November 2026 (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nSecure your next home before Christmas! \r\n\r\nBeautifully presented and thoughtfully designed, this contemporary and standalone four-bedroom home offers stylish interiors, modern comforts and a well-planned layout across two levels, all in a sought-after Mairangi Bay location with exceptional school zones.\r\n\r\nLocation is a standout advantage. Families can enjoy access to four highly sought-after school zones:\r\n* Rangitoto College\r\n* Westlake Girls' High School\r\n* Mairangi Bay School - approximately 85m away\r\n* Murrays Bay Intermediate\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n* 4 bedrooms and 2.5 bathrooms, including a spacious master suite with an ensuite, walk-in wardrobe featuring LED lighting, and its own heat pump.\r\n* Elegant living area with a statement feature wall, floating TV cabinetry, ambient LED lighting, built-in audio system and stylish glass stair balustrades.\r\n* Contemporary kitchen and dining featuring a central island, sleek cabinetry and quality appliances, designed for effortless everyday living and entertaining.\r\n* Seamless indoor-outdoor flow from the living and kitchen areas to a private, level deck with low-maintenance outdoor space.\r\n* Beautifully finished bathrooms with floor-to-ceiling tiling, including a family bathroom with a bathtub.\r\n* Year-round comfort with 2 heat pumps and the central vacuum system.\r\n* Internal-access single garage complete with a dedicated laundry, built-in storage cabinetry and practical workbench.\r\n\r\nBeyond the excellent schooling options, enjoy the relaxed coastal lifestyle Mairangi Bay is known for. Beautiful beaches, local cafés, shops and parks are all within easy reach, while Wairau Valley shopping and motorway connections provide everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nMake Your Move Before Christmas!\r\n\r\nWith the festive season approaching, this is your chance to secure a beautifully appointed family home in one of the North Shore's most desirable coastal neighbourhoods. A stylish home, outstanding school zones and an enviable lifestyle - all in one exceptional address.\r\n\r\nDon't miss the deadline! Contact us today to arrange your private viewing or visit our open homes.",
